{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>22歲香港「網球一哥」黃澤林早前宣告結束半年情，隨即火速戀上新歡譚旻萱，因而捲入無縫交接爭議。即使男方親自開腔 …</p><p></p>\n<p>22歲香港「網球一哥」黃澤林早前宣告結束半年情，隨即火速戀上新歡譚旻萱，因而捲入無縫交接爭議。即使男方親自開腔解畫，外界對這段發展神速的感情依然充滿好奇。昨日他毫不避忌地帶同女方出席長輩飯局，認愛後終於同框的畫面為這段關係帶來全新衝擊。</p>\n<h2>九巴後人雷禮權大晒黃澤林飯局合照</h2>\n<p>九巴後人雷禮權昨日在個人社交平台分享與好友聚餐大合照，令這對話題情侶認愛後終於同框曝光。相中可見黃澤林身穿淺藍色短袖T恤配深色長褲，面對鏡頭展露招牌燦爛笑容，而身旁的譚旻萱則穿上白色長袖上衣襯鬆身牛仔褲，臉帶微笑表情略顯拘謹。雷禮權在貼文寫上「Coleman came over for dinner」，直接公開兩人結伴出席長輩飯敍這項消息。</p>\n<h2>男主角親上網台交代無縫交接爭議</h2>\n<p>面對外界猛烈抨擊，黃澤林早前登上網台節目親自釐清換畫時間線。他堅稱在9月已經與舊愛分開，並強調「當時係佢提出分手，分手原因完全無關第三者介入」，力證自己並未出軌。他補充指出去到10月才與現任女友在乾淨情況下認識及了解，隨後才正式確立情侶關係。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱9月搬入西貢新居引重疊疑雲</h2>\n<p>男方連番保證絕無劈腿，但眼尖網民翻查資料後揪出關鍵時間點。有人發現譚旻萱早於9月已經搬入西貢新居，甚至有傳該處正是兩人共築愛巢，這個搬家時間恰巧與舊戀情結束月份重疊。加上他與舊愛拍拖僅短短半年就火速散場，令大批網民持續在各大討論區發文深挖各項線索。</p>\n<h2>網民聚焦討論陳康堤前度極速換畫行為</h2>\n<p>兩人高調同框照片曝光後，各大討論區隨即湧現海量評論。有網民留言嘲諷「咁快就帶出嚟見長輩，真係好心急」、「時間線點計都係怪怪地」，質疑雙方發展進度過於急進。亦有部分人將注意力放在兩人外型配搭上，表示「其實佢哋身高外型都幾襯」、「後生仔女拍拖好正常」，雙方陣營在網上持續激烈交鋒。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410417498292_17630430156b0007c8be407.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410417498292_17630430156b0007c8be407.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410535268195_5298964226b0007c9c10b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410535268195_5298964226b0007c9c10b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179406583387227910_21460113896aef45aa2f903.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"劉穎鏇 莊錠欣 Mandy和黃澤林早前公開戀情！（圖片來源：IG圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179406583387227910_21460113896aef45aa2f903.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy和黃澤林早前公開戀情！（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540003819406_1811854566ae8b4486de26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 他明確指出這段關係告終完全不涉及第三者介入，並爆料表示：「其實係佢提出分手」。（圖片來源：IG圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540003819406_1811854566ae8b4486de26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>他明確指出這段關係告終完全不涉及第三者介入，並爆料表示：「其實係佢提出分手」。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285113503099231_9482324906adcbcc022a81.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 陳康堤10月24日出席公開活動時，首度親口證實與黃澤林分手，正式宣布恢復單身。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285113503099231_9482324906adcbcc022a81.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳康堤10月24日出席公開活動時，首度親口證實與黃澤林分手，正式宣布恢復單身。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%97%bb%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚旻萱</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%ba%b7%e5%a0%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳康堤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e6%be%a4%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃澤林</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546773\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:03:54.434303+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1301,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:41:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:22.432535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:22.432535+00:00","content_hash":"1c9e29214dc5e02fa004cd77be964b6213e99f06ef3a2f2d055264b4fb7bfbcc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}